<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Medallion Financial cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Medallion Financial cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns initiated coverage of Medallion Financial Corp with an attractive rating, according to a Bear Stearns source.</p>
<p>-- shares were unchanged at 14-1/2.</p>
